      "thermo_standard_state_violation_frac": "fraction of active reactions with v * (delta_r_G0 + delta_r_G_transport) > thermo_epsilon. An AUDIT REFERENCE, not the layer's own term: it evaluates the second law at standard state because an arm with thermo_mode OFF learns no concentrations, so the concentration term RT S^T ln c is absent rather than zero.",
